   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt; text-align: justify;">Of the <ix:nonFraction id="c139408485" contextRef="d_2024-12-01_2025-11-30_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">137,001</ix:nonFraction> shares issued upon exercise of options during the year ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> November 30, 2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c139408486" contextRef="d_2024-12-01_2025-11-30_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:SharesPaidForTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">36,807</ix:nonFraction> options were surrendered due to cashless exercise.&#160;Of the <ix:nonFraction id="c139408487" contextRef="d_2023-12-01_2024-11-30_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">292,827</ix:nonFraction> shares issued upon exercise of options during the year ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> November 30, 2024</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c139408488" contextRef="d_2023-12-01_2024-11-30_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:SharesPaidForTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">61,859</ix:nonFraction>&#160;options were surrendered due to cashless exercise.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt; text-align: justify;">The stock options outstanding at the end of the year had weighted-average contractual life as follows:</p>
