   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">A reconciliation of the Company&#8217;s statutory income tax rate to the Company&#8217;s effective income&#160;tax rate is as follows:</p>
